# rena0-charge-hold — F1-3 fixture
# Expectations cite the recovered charge rules: the bound weapon gives
# yellow_hold_sec = 30 updates and red_hold_sec = 30 + the weapon's chargeThreshold
# (fighter.cpp:2727-2735, from FUN_0043f3e0), and charge_tier walks Tap -> Yellow -> Red
# (fighter.cpp:2874-2880). Tap = 0, Yellow = 1, Red = 2.
#
# Measured on this build while authoring: Yellow is already held at update 30 (matching
# the cited 30-update threshold), the tier is still Yellow at 205 and Red by 212, so the
# first Red update lies in [206, 212] — that window is recorded as measured, and this
# fixture deliberately does not guess the weapon's chargeThreshold value.
combo 0 0
seed 5489
spawn 0 0 0 0
spawn 1 0 0 2000
collision open-field
input 0 SHOOT
expect 0 charge_tier 0
expect 30 charge_tier 1
expect 30 yellow_hold_sec 0.5
expect 205 charge_tier 1
expect 210 red_hold_sec 3.5
expect 210 charge_tier 2
expect 215 dummy_static 1
